# DepotDirect API Authentication Test

This file contains test requests for the DepotDirect API authentication functionality.

### 1. Test Public Endpoint (No Auth Required)
GET http://localhost:5204/public/status

### 2. Test Login with Valid Credentials (admin)
POST http://localhost:5204/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 3. Test Login with Valid Credentials (user)
POST http://localhost:5204/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "user123"
}

### 4. Test Login with Invalid Credentials
POST http://localhost:5204/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 5. Test Protected Endpoint with Basic Auth (admin)
GET http://localhost:5204/weatherforecast
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 6. Test Protected Endpoint with Basic Auth (user)
GET http://localhost:5204/weatherforecast
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz

### 7. Test Protected Endpoint without Auth (should fail)
GET http://localhost:5204/weatherforecast

### 8. Get User Profile with Basic Auth
GET http://localhost:5204/profile
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 9. Test Admin Endpoint with Admin User (Basic Auth)
GET http://localhost:5204/admin/users
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 10. Test Admin Endpoint with Regular User (should fail)
GET http://localhost:5204/admin/users
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz

### 11. Test Protected Endpoint with JWT Token (get token from login first)
GET http://localhost:5204/weatherforecast
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 12. Test Profile with JWT Token
GET http://localhost:5204/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

##################################################
# COUNTRIES API TESTS
##################################################

### 13. Get all countries
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 14. Get a specific country by ID
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries/1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

### 15. Create a new country
POST http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "United States",
  "isoCode": "US",
  "metadata": {}
}

### 16. Update a country
PUT http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries/1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "India Updated",
  "isoCode": "IN",
  "metadata": {}
}

### 17. Search countries
GET http://localhost:5204/api/admin/countries/search?query=india
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

